SCOPE

This license applies equally to every component of the pmxtools suite
published or released from this repository index: pmxtools-cli (the
command-line tool) and pmxtools-ui (the desktop application), in source or
binary form, together with their documentation and release artifacts. In
the text below, "the software" means each of them, individually and
together. Both are closed-source and are developed in private repositories;
this repository is a public release index only and contains no application
source code.

